   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Opening Song**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2010-08-17** (recommended): source not stated; 25 songs; 145 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer describes the audio as capturing the lakefront atmosphere with great sound quality [4]\n- **mmj2010-08-17.remaster.flac16**: source not stated; 25 songs; 145 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2010-08-17**: taped by Kelly Casey; transferred by Kelly Casey; source: Neumann SKM 184's 90 degrees > Audio Magic Sceptor 2 Cables > Lunatec V-2 > Zoom H4n > SDHC 24/48k. Just barely left of center FOB 7 Foot high on a stand. [1]. Also: Audio transferred from SDHC to PC, processed in Audacity, and saved as Flac [1]\n- **mmj2010-08-17.remaster.flac16**: taped by Kelly Casey; transferred by Kelly Casey; source: Neumann SKM 184's 90 degrees > Audio Magic Sceptor 2 Cables > Lunatec V-2 > Zoom H4n > SDHC 24/48k. Just barely left of center FOB 7 Foot high on a stand. [2]",
